### Get all market posts
GET {{host}}/market/items/all
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get all market posts and filter
GET {{host}}/market/items/all?title=yellow
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Getlogged in customer's market posts
GET {{host}}/market/items/me
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Create Market Post
POST {{host}}/market/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "title": "Yellow garri",
  "category": "FOODSTUFFS",
  "availableUnit": "8 bags",
  "photoUrl": "https://www.google.com",
  "price": 50000,
  "description": "This is correct Akwa Ibom yellow garri"
}

### Update Market Post
PUT {{host}}/market/items/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "title": "Yellow garri - Updated"
}


### Get market posts by Id
GET {{host}}/market/items/3
Authorization: {{customer_token}}